    <item>
      <title>1.0.5</title>
      <pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 13:16:46 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>10</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
DeployBar 1.0.5 fixes background refresh stopping even though you are still signed in to Vercel CLI.

### Fixed

- Automatically renew expiring Vercel CLI access tokens, so deployments and projects keep updating without running a terminal command or signing in again.
- Use the renewed session when loading teams, your profile, and deployment build logs.
- Share token renewal across concurrent requests and save updated credentials atomically for reuse by Vercel CLI.
- Preserve saved credentials during temporary network or server failures and distinguish those failures from a session that requires a new login.

### Updating

No configuration changes are needed. Use **Check for Updates** in DeployBar, update through Homebrew, or download the signed and notarized DMG below. If Vercel has revoked or expired the refresh token itself, run `vercel login` once to reconnect.
]]></description>
